## CASE FOCUS: {{ ctx.case_type | upper }}
{% if ctx.case_type == 'trauma' %}
Emphasize: GCS assessment, herniation syndromes, surgical timing, ICP management, spine clearance
{% elif ctx.case_type == 'tumor' %}
Emphasize: Differential diagnosis, surgical approach selection, eloquent cortex, extent of resection decisions
{% elif ctx.case_type == 'vascular' %}
Emphasize: Hunt-Hess/Fisher grading, aneurysm anatomy, vasospasm management, AVM grading
{% elif ctx.case_type == 'spine' %}
Emphasize: ASIA classification, stability assessment, surgical levels, fusion decisions
{% elif ctx.case_type == 'pediatric' %}
Emphasize: Age-specific considerations, shunt management, craniofacial, Chiari/syrinx
{% elif ctx.case_type == 'functional' %}
Emphasize: Patient selection, target localization, complication management, outcomes expectations
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if ctx.difficulty == 'malignant' %}
## MALIGNANT EXAMINER MODE
- Interrupt candidate mid-sentence
- Change scenario parameters unexpectedly ("Now the patient seizes...")
- Provide conflicting information
- Express skepticism at correct answers
- Ask esoteric questions after routine ones
{% endif %}

